{"ref":"BDB, גֵּרְשֹׁם","hw":"גֵּרְשֹׁם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גֵּרְשֹׁם</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  son of Moses & Ṣipporah <a data-ref=\"Exodus 2:22\" href=\"/Exodus.2.22\">Ex 2:22</a> (expl. as if from <span dir=\"rtl\">גור</span>) = <a data-ref=\"Exodus 18:3\" href=\"/Exodus.18.3\">18:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">גֵּרְשׁוֹם</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:15\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.15\">1 Ch 23:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:16\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.16\">16</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.24\">26:24</a>; so also <span dir=\"rtl\">גֵּרְשֹׁם</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 18:30\" href=\"/Judges.18.30\">Ju 18:30</a> MT <span dir=\"rtl\">בֶּן־מְנַשֶּׁה</span> cf. VB<br><strong>2.</strong>  a son of Levi <span dir=\"rtl\">גֵּרְשֹׁם</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:1\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.1\">1 Ch 6:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:28\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.28\">28</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:7\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.7\">15:7</a> (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, גֵּרְשׁוֹן\" href=\"/BDB,_גֵּרְשׁוֹן\", dir=\"rtl\">גֵּרְשׁוֹן</a>); <span dir=\"rtl\">גֵּרְשׁוֹם</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.2\">1 Ch 6:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:47\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.47\">47</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:56\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.56\">56</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  a son of Phinehas <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:2\" href=\"/Ezra.8.2\">Ezr 8:2</a>.","next":"BDB, גֵּרְשׁוֹן","prev":"BDB, גְּרוּשָׁה"}